@startuml
title Ask-SLM Delivery Architecture (Manager-Focused)

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "Research Engineer" as User

component "runner.ipynb\n(Notebook Trigger)" as Notebook
component "askslm.py -> cli.py\n(CLI Trigger)" as CLI
component "managers/runner_pipeline_manager.py\n(Orchestration)" as Pipeline
component "SRAWorkspaceInputAccessor" as WorkspaceInputAccessor
component "MappingEngine" as MappingEngine
component "EnvoResolutionEngine" as EnvoEngine
component "TaxonomyAccessor\n(lineage DB)" as LineageAccessor

component "AlphaDiversityEngine::alpha_diversity_metrics" as AlphaCompute
component "TaxonomicAbundanceEngine::taxonomic_abundance_metrics" as AbundanceCompute

component "MappingConfigManager\n(Jupyter UI)" as MappingUI
component "AlphaDiversityEngine\n(Jupyter UI)" as AlphaUI
component "TaxonomicAbundanceEngine\n(Jupyter UI)" as AbundanceUI

database "Workspaces/<workspace>/inputs/metadata.csv" as WsMeta
database "Workspaces/<workspace>/inputs/taxonomy.csv" as WsTax
database "Workspaces/<workspace>/mapping_configs/*.json" as WsConfigs
database "Workspaces/<workspace>/results/*" as WsResults
database "Workspaces/<workspace>/results/_cache/*" as WsCache

User --> Notebook
User --> CLI

Notebook --> Pipeline
Pipeline --> WorkspaceInputAccessor
WorkspaceInputAccessor --> WsMeta
WorkspaceInputAccessor --> WsTax

Pipeline --> MappingEngine
Pipeline --> EnvoEngine
Pipeline --> LineageAccessor
Pipeline --> WsConfigs
Pipeline --> WsResults
Pipeline --> WsCache

Notebook --> MappingUI
Notebook --> AlphaUI
Notebook --> AbundanceUI
MappingUI --> WsConfigs
AlphaUI --> LineageAccessor
AlphaUI --> WsResults
AbundanceUI --> WsResults

CLI --> WsMeta
CLI --> WsTax
CLI --> WsConfigs
CLI --> WsResults
CLI --> WsCache
CLI --> AlphaCompute
CLI --> AbundanceCompute

AlphaCompute --> LineageAccessor

note bottom
Manager-critical complexity lives in:
1) runner stage cache/stamp orchestration
2) mapping-config lifecycle and missing-config fallback
3) CLI runtime path resolution and lineage precondition for alpha-diversity
end note

@enduml